{"id":"n64762-1-8","stage":5,"title":"수혜자 · 受益者","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64762-1-8-1","ko":"두 나라가 무역 협정을 맺었대.","zh":"听说两国签订了贸易协定呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나라가","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무역","meaning":"国际贸易","explanation":"무역：国际贸易","readings":[{"term":"무역","audio":"/audio/70faf71978350790a5e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64740","senseId":"2","lemma":"무역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"협정을","meaning":"协定，条约，公约","explanation":"협정：协定，条约，公约；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"협정","audio":"/audio/fe2e6afffeffe02187f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86041","senseId":"2","lemma":"협정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맺었대.","meaning":"缔结","explanation":"맺다：缔结；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"맺다","audio":"/audio/623e599b6dea2061ff2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15976","senseId":"5","lemma":"맺다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"70faf71978350790","term":"무역","zh":"国际贸易","audio":"/audio/70faf71978350790a5e0.mp3","entryId":"64740","definition":"国与国之间互相进行物品交易的行为。","pronunciation":["무ː역"]},{"id":"fe2e6afffeffe021","term":"협정","zh":"协定，条约，公约","audio":"/audio/fe2e6afffeffe02187f0.mp3","entryId":"86041","definition":"一个国家与其他国家达成约定；或指这种约定。","pronunciation":["협쩡"]},{"id":"623e599b6dea2061","term":"맺다","zh":"缔结","audio":"/audio/623e599b6dea2061ff2f.mp3","entryId":"15976","definition":"人与人之间建立人际关系。","pronunciation":["맫따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2de0acc26864c719145.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64762-1-8-2","ko":"양국의 기업들이 가장 큰 수혜자가 되겠군.","zh":"两国的企业应该会是最大的受益者吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"양국의","meaning":"两国","explanation":"양국：两国；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"양국","audio":"/audio/966789245c46a5ab1c8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14319","senseId":"1","lemma":"양국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기업들이","meaning":"企业，公司","explanation":"기업：企业，公司；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기업","audio":"/audio/120a4a40716cc36a6a5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32514","senseId":"1","lemma":"기업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가장","meaning":"最","explanation":"가장：最","readings":[{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26795","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰","meaning":"巨大，深，重，沉重","explanation":"크다：巨大，深，重，沉重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"7","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수혜자가","meaning":"受益者，受惠者","explanation":"수혜자：受益者，受惠者；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"수혜자","audio":"/audio/f482febf29120fd11c34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64762","senseId":"1","lemma":"수혜자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되겠군.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"966789245c46a5ab","term":"양국","zh":"两国","audio":"/audio/966789245c46a5ab1c8e.mp3","entryId":"14319","definition":"两方的国家。","pronunciation":["양ː국"]},{"id":"120a4a40716cc36a","term":"기업","zh":"企业，公司","audio":"/audio/120a4a40716cc36a6a5d.mp3","entryId":"32514","definition":"以营利为目的而进行生产、销售、流通等经济活动的组织。","pronunciation":["기업"]},{"id":"8fd32c9572450a80","term":"가장","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3","entryId":"26795","definition":"多个中占第一。","pronunciation":["가장"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"巨大，深，重，沉重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的影响、冲击等很大。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"f482febf29120fd1","term":"수혜자","zh":"受益者，受惠者","audio":"/audio/f482febf29120fd11c34.mp3","entryId":"64762","definition":"得到利益或帮助的人。","pronunciation":["수혜자","수헤자"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e59efa038eb013954d91.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.538,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64762","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3647,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["两国的企业应该会是最大的受益者吧。","上完厕所记得冲马桶！","听说两国签订了贸易协定呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["两国的企业应该会是最大的受益者吧。","听说两国签订了贸易协定呢。","上完厕所记得冲马桶！"],"answer":0}]}
